/si.imgix.net/830c5e48/uploads/outputs/b82a8388-b8b2-44a8-bab9-5d7231cbcbb8?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a66858881e2bd9b9c2badf328aab3497", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/830c5e48/uploads/outputs/b82a8388-b8b2-44a8-bab9-5d7231cbcbb8?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a66858881e2bd9b9c2badf328aab3497, https://si.imgix.net/830c5e48/uploads/outputs/b82a8388-b8b2-44a8-bab9-5d7231cbcbb8?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4f07295a470f477488e551d5f885abac 2x, https://si.imgix.net/830c5e48/uploads/outputs/b82a8388-b8b2-44a8-bab9-5d7231cbcbb8?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7d95932adf846a7fff66d7420694e03a 3x"}, "body": "はじめまして！\n個人勢vtuber準備中の Luoyuと申します。\n\nやっこさんの作品のやわらかい光と色づかいに一目惚れしてしまい、\nぜひルナモの世界を描いていただきたいと思い、リクエストを送らせていただきました。\n\n\n出す金額が低すぎる場合は、リクエストを再送してください！\nもしよろしければリクエストを受け付けていただけると大変助かります。\n\n【キャラクター】\n・名前：ルナモ\n・種族：星の雲から生まれた意識体（うさ耳の精霊）\n・性格：穏やかで理性的、でも少しおしゃべりで好奇心旺盛\n・好きなもの：星、雲、リボン、絵を描くこと\n・雰囲気：やわらかく温かい宇宙の工房主\n\n【要望】\n・ルナモのイラスト、または配信用の雰囲気絵\n・温かく可愛い雰囲気で、やさしい光の中にいるような印象\n・表情はおだやかで、見る人が少し癒されるような感じ\n・ 16:9の比率\n\n【使用用途】\n・配信・SNS投稿・紹介画像などの使用予定\n・ファン向けの世界観資料やアートブック掲載の可能性あり\n\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします☁️🌙✨\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1f0QC_RAMkZKHIgGrd2hXmqZYpdPW03I5?usp=drive_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Pixel25258/works/70", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3260456, "client_id": 3284336, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c49b741b/uploads/origins/8c3e5ff1-e083-4b4b-b01b-7186ca6185ca?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0778fd0d71155c7213fe408406ee6a29", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c49b741b/uploads/origins/8c3e5ff1-e083-4b4b-b01b-7186ca6185ca?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0778fd0d71155c7213fe408406ee6a29, https://si.imgix.net/c49b741b/uploads/origins/8c3e5ff1-e083-4b4b-b01b-7186ca6185ca?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7453babcb8b4ed43ab22963a413e775e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c49b741b/uploads/origins/8c3e5ff1-e083-4b4b-b01b-7186ca6185ca?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c106466266a3db0a2a3afe161944a073 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c49b741b/uploads/origins/8c3e5ff1-e083-4b4b-b01b-7186ca6185ca?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=58c9614ff57dbaa5ad126d19c5ed215f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c49b741b/uploads/origins/8c3e5ff1-e083-4b4b-b01b-7186ca6185ca?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=58c9614ff57dbaa5ad126d19c5ed215f, https://si.imgix.net/c49b741b/uploads/origins/8c3e5ff1-e083-4b4b-b01b-7186ca6185ca?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c26df9b46d41d00d033abe885adb195a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c49b741b/uploads/origins/8c3e5ff1-e083-4b4b-b01b-7186ca6185ca?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aae36e2cc3931316f4d61fbcfe74088d 3x"}, "body": "Hello!\nI really love your pixel artwork — your soft color palette and subtle animation details are absolutely charming!\nI'd love to commission a \"starting soon\" pixel illustration featuring my Vtuber character\n\n✦ Concept/Feeling:\nThe illustration should give off a cozy, friendly vibe — like “let’s play a game together” or “let’s do some crafting”.\nLunamo is a bunny-eared celestial elf who runs an art & crafting workshop near the edge of the nebula. She’s gentle, calm, and warm like a quiet companion beside you.(with good body shape too)\n\n✦ Elements to include (if possible):\n\nFloating bunny or cloud pet(s)\n\nRibbons, stars, drawing tools or handmade items\n\nLunamo wearing her pajama-style outfit (reference image provided)\n\n16:9 screen ratio to be used as a streaming layout\n\n✦ Mood & Palette Suggestions:\nI really adore your soft and dreamy pink color tones!\nPlease feel free to draw in your style and add any cute elements that inspire you! As long as you're having fun drawing her, I'm sure it will be perfect !\n\nthere’s a link to her references and design\nThank you so much for your time and consideration! Looking forward to it!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1f0QC_RAMkZKHIgGrd2hXmqZYpdPW03I5", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Carrot_Ninjin/works/33", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2278093, "client_id": 3284336, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/14238800/uploads/outputs/dda2be6c-569a-4dfa-af0f-f477cc565722?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6318063ef24d91a33a26e165fd2ec875", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/14238800/uploads/outputs/dda2be6c-569a-4dfa-af0f-f477cc565722?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6318063ef24d91a33a26e165fd2ec875, https://si.imgix.net/14238800/uploads/outputs/dda2be6c-569a-4dfa-af0f-f477cc565722?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f86ab51bc6888f1aa5764b2ee05c7b09 2x, https://si.imgix.net/14238800/uploads/outputs/dda2be6c-569a-4dfa-af0f-f477cc565722?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41a6ca378a8caede54d68429718093e2 3x"}, "duration": 4, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/14238800/uploads/outputs/dda2be6c-569a-4dfa-af0f-f477cc565722?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=67b460e4f191e6a2447f1fb8424b4987", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/14238800/uploads/outputs/dda2be6c-569a-4dfa-af0f-f477cc565722?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=67b460e4f191e6a2447f1fb8424b4987, https://si.imgix.net/14238800/uploads/outputs/dda2be6c-569a-4dfa-af0f-f477cc565722?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4c2a2cd1eb8123618d0e90e2cadeb38d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/14238800/uploads/outputs/dda2be6c-569a-4dfa-af0f-f477cc565722?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cdd9b6a1c50bf087dcf38ea1d5e2e98e 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I really admire your animation work!\nI’d love to request a short animation for my stream’s “Starting Soon” screen featuring my Vtuber character Lunamo.\n\nShe’s a celestial rabbit-eared spirit who runs an art studio floating in the outer edges of a starry nebula. For the animation, I imagine Lunamo in the center of the screen, with one hand raised gently — holding or conjuring a swirl of cloud and stars in the air.\n\nIn front of her, there can be a few vials with glowing poppy flowers, or a purple gradient glass drawing tablet — these are elements from her lore that symbolize her dual identity as both artist and wanderer.\n\nHer expression can be calm and soft, like she’s preparing to welcome the viewer quietly into her space.\n\nYou’re welcome to interpret freely!\nHere’s her character reference folder:\n\nThank you so much for your consideration! 🌌\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1f0QC_RAMkZKHIgGrd2hXmqZYpdPW03I5?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Enokido/works/637", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "music", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1852954, "client_id": 3284336, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1924285448425263104%2FTQtScN8G.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6918b3ec7